", "timestamp_created": 1635700956, "timestamp_updated": 1635700956, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101973799", "author": {"steamid": "76561198150921315", "personaname": "Backstab0", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198150921315/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 26, "playtime_forever": 4002, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2802, "last_played": 1671290160, "avatar": "6330c0531c83e7262767b52a29728f6801bcc289"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "我觉得特感们进化的如此全面，人类灭亡就灭亡了吧，该给新人类让让道了。\n——\n打L4D2卡关，我会思考哪个特感没处理好，哪波走位不到位，哪个tank没拉好，总会发现一些能提升的问题。\n——\n打B4B卡关，我只会感叹怎么所有怪都特么血妈硬，弱点反馈跟没有一样（其他游戏打弱点是特攻，这逼游戏打弱点才是正常伤害...），被视野外控制抓，被大手穿墙抓，被自爆怪顶着火力冲锋炸烂你。还有，无穷无尽的堆怪。\n折磨，麻烦制作组，玩玩自己做的游戏，球球了-、=", "timestamp_created": 1635697723, "timestamp_updated": 1635697723, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.501097500324249268", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 13, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "101972704", "author": {"steamid": "76561198148614322", "personaname": "ZhiWu", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198148614322/", "num_games_owned": 158, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 4057, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1572, "last_played": 1638015540, "avatar": "cfc13c1e2738f2a52bf2592a0be376f8304201c2"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "他是真的没自己玩过", "timestamp_created": 1635696740, "timestamp_updated": 1637369343, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101970663", "author": {"steamid": "76561198057409549", "personaname": "Bishop", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198057409549/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 3969, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3823, "last_played": 1635779615, "avatar": "923d99c50c8e0f675915568b7fbb98c64935809c"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "不论价格的话，已经可以玩了。论价格的话，对不起这个价格。\n半成品感觉强烈，不值得原价购入，应该等待内容扩充和打折之后购买。\n有些例行的小bug，不过快20天了都不更新，不知道他们制作者想怎么样。\n\n\n还有就是不明所以的难度设定，不面向只图一乐玩家。\n难度不是随剧情增长的，例如：剧情有4个章节，然而最快最简单的第二章7-1已经成为刷抽卡牌点数的圣地。\n有新手，老兵，噩梦三个难度，每个难度之间的差距是天上地下。\n和BOT打新手还可以，打老兵简直找死（个人体验）", "timestamp_created": 1635694947, "timestamp_updated": 1635694947, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101968482", "author": {"steamid": "76561198451759410", "personaname": "摆烂咯", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198451759410/", "num_games_owned": 144, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 743, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 628, "last_played": 1771685144, "avatar": "b2732234f3fbed341c241f58e1848418941f7d92"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "朋友口了我一个小时我才答应买和他一起玩", "timestamp_created": 1635693025, "timestamp_updated": 1659888916, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "ste