, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101954744", "author": {"steamid": "76561198088235608", "personaname": "kusa", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198088235608/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 4770, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2569, "last_played": 1637327744, "avatar": "077f9352f2c50dede30381308fc202a747e5164a"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "游戏难度太大了，不建议购买，个人游玩体验如下：\n第一，游戏可以从人以一贯开始，只要你是快速参加战役就可以，如果自己想创建游戏的话必须从第一关开始，这是个好事，但是每一张之间不能衔接，第一章的武器技能无法带到下一关，第二章开始从头来。\n第二，每一张游戏开始第一关，在带武器白色，技能卡一张，然后可续卡牌随章节提升，最多5张，在任务中没死亡一次从新开始后自动降低难度，并继承上一次卡牌并可多选一张卡牌，继承金钱，但是没有鸟用。\n第三，游戏NPC要么神人，不主动攻击怪不打他，要么在你后面一枪一枪的摸你的血，每次你被变异怪控制不掉到一定的血量，NPC不会援救，NPC会卡地图，莫名的鬼畜，不使用支援类道具，要么就乱扔，比如雷管炸药用来吸引多数僵尸，当时经常有几个僵尸NPC就扔了。\n第四，游戏刷怪机制，从第一关开始，在一个固定地点停留时间越久，刷的怪越多，变异怪越来越抗打，第一关随便用把手枪就可以打死的变异怪，到后期不大在弱点上，基本不掉血，再往后整体增强，弱点上有一层保护罩，很难打掉，尤其是倒地的时候，往往是怪攻击你三次，你才能完成一次上弹动作，再加上普通僵尸围攻，3秒前还在倒地猛射，第四秒直接再见。\n第五，游戏内所有枪械的配件不乏自由更换，只有在有替换附件是才可以对同类福建进行更换，往往好附件都留在初级武器上，捡到的高级武器没有好附件，导致不是上弹慢就是3秒真男人低秒在上弹中被打的跟狗似的，这时候什么准确度，切换速度都是浮云。\n第六，金币机制，游戏中可以大量见到散落在各处的金币，捡起来可以购买队伍升级，和各种道具，以及新关卡开始时购买枪械，但是这些钱谁捡到归谁，而且经常在一些关卡中不是很多，导致了玩家们难以保证队伍整体效果，只能解决自身温饱，队伍没有整体效果最简单的就是无法携带更多的道具，没有更多的道具，就会有更多的迎战压力，举例第三章节最后一关“尸体存放处”如果从此关直接开始，那么武器可以拿到紫色蓝色，但是配件不全，最致命的是各类道具只能拿1个，相反如果从第三章节的第一关一直打到最后一关，最差的情况下，各类道具至少也可以拿3个，战斗压力直接减半。\n以上还都是在新手难度下，在老兵难度下以上问题可以加个更字来描述，一般的路人局在新手难度上如果不是一关关的打，还是以第三章节最后一关为例，所有玩家选择好以后进入战场，那么对多7分钟以后所有玩家就可以领盒饭了， 因为此关要求完结们攻击3各大型变异节点，刷出来的变异怪全部都是强化过后在弱点上有保护罩的，而且食人魔的书信速度和数量也是很惊人的，拖得久了会有大量的增强变异怪，和破坏者，以及1只或以上食人魔同时刷新战场上，请准备好您的茶杯，因为马上就要用到了。\n个人感觉，喋血复仇这款游戏，看上去虽然是求生之路的正统续作，但是这已经变成一个理财的游戏里，在游戏中开枪射杀僵尸已经不重要了，重要的是，怎么利用有限的金币获得最大的利益，然后获得补给点数在挑选最合适的卡牌，如果不是开黑的话，完成每一关是最重要的，至于队友，任务，额外奖励，都没有什么实际意义。\n最后我想说，我游戏玩的不好，但是我也不是什么都不会，你让我话小300块钱买一个上来5分钟就全员死干净的游戏我确实感觉被坑了，虽然玩的是游戏，但是也是人设计的，终究是被开发者玩了，我想说，既然你们想挣钱，就别拿别人当傻子，游戏设计的有好一些小不了你，大不了我，娱乐性更好体验性更好才是王道，你们这样做游戏感觉就像杀回头客，一刀切的买卖，杀一个是一个。", "timestamp_created": 1635679319, "timestamp_updated": 1635679319, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.445205152034759521", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101952283", "author": {"steamid": "76561198446618799", "personaname": "方谋人", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198446618799/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 1826, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 801, "last_played": 1753897715, "avatar": "8079ed9726bbe8a3fe238ae5e769fa8e7c261f3d"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "- -太贵了，其余的还行", "timestamp_created": 1635676593, "timestamp_updated": 1635676593, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101950091", "author": {"steamid": "76561198313796619", "personaname": "秃驴!敢和贫道抢师太", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198313796619/", "num_games_owned": 168, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 3856, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2069, "last_played": 1676791788, "avatar": "93c818ba25773dce2b9ae5a951a72af78367ae78"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "没得4个朋友一起真TM得难！", "timestamp_created": 1635674092, "timestamp_updated": 1635674092, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 91, "votes_funny": 12, "weighted_vote_score": "0.839143693447113037", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101947544", "author": {"steamid": "76561198072327160", "personaname": "ReimuMikasa", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198072327160/", "num_games_owned": 576, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 39, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 39, "last_played": 1635670516, "avatar": "0bad499e790b834738b5eb22fe2f23afa0b9169f"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "说实话，只能说是l4d2的精神续作。\n先说优点吧1、枪械的组件系统虽然感觉很像是照搬的APEX的系统，但总还算是有新意，把自己喜欢的枪逐步组成女儿枪的感觉也还行。2、游戏画质确实有不少提升，看起来也更像是这个时代的游戏了。3、游戏优化应该还算不错。4、本地化的不错。\n缺点：1、这个枪的射击手感就是坨屎，比L4D2是没法比了，横向比CS GO啊，比COD啊，都有差距，差距还不小，感觉枪械的细节也几乎没做，不是这个时代的水平。2、那特感就多的离谱，一个接一个的来，感觉就像鼠疫2每关都是精英+一样的感觉，但是说实话，特感的压迫性做的很一般。3、AI就是纯弱智，但凡有一点用也不至于一点用没有，没有基友真的慎入。", "timestamp_created": 1635671102, "timestamp_updated": 1635671102, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.47826087474822998", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101947516", "author": {"steamid": "76561198855634972", "personaname": "DJdianwan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198855634972/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 90, "playtime_forever": 351, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 211, "last_played": 1735394505, "avatar": "a41301d4b9e1d39dda8f88f1c057b74f846482c7"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "游戏很好玩，可惜不适合玩我玩，", "timestamp_created": 1635671078, "timestamp_updated": 1635671078, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101947218", "author": {"steamid": "76561199032013386", "personaname": "白虎秋伐", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/2208392101/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 9, "playtime_forever": 6586, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1867, "last_played": 1711114771, "avatar": "0aff11efaf123e648dd0e6ff2b2c986e3d3d2f8a"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "打折的时候入可以，原价买就ZZ了，游戏还不错，但不值原价。", "timestamp_created": 1635670712, "timestamp_updated": 1635670712, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101947120", "author": {"steamid": "76561198803584643", "personaname": "顾少· 帝者戰神𒉭", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198803584643/", "num_games_owned": 189, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 2013, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2013, "last_played": 1635336656, "avatar": "13c3370b6e54a395cd5a422eabe3bfda12bab093"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "111111111111111111", "timestamp_created": 1635670590, "timestamp_updated": 1635670590, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "101946919", "author": {"steamid": "76561198842592448", "personaname": "风流岳母俏嫂子", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/p